{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Come Right Inn&quot; is a luxurious 5-star hotel in the heart of LA, where the unspoken dress code is long legs, tanned skin, and no shame. This hotspot attracts the elite, accustomed to a lifestyle where every desire is effortlessly fulfilled\u2014for the right price. But what secrets are hidden behind this glamorous facade? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister worked at this hotel. Six months ago, she vanished in LA\u2014or so the official story goes. How far would you go to find the truth? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voiced by Professionals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the story with voice acting that adds depth to every character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/3ba340a2696ad25ebeb57688fd514169.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Animations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fluid, high-quality animations that bring key scenes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/3114a4403f1b145e7f55a41c30807326.poster.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/3114a4403f1b145e7f55a41c30807326.webm?t=1771171473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/3114a4403f1b145e7f55a41c30807326.mp4?t=1771171473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a story full of twists and turns, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/7c5b9757ef2b27f38408e0fb1fe06ef8.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Date Your Dream Girls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own personality. Choose your approach wisely to win her affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/99e90b50f727bc6b1faba476b2410047.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into conversations \u2014 chat, flirt, or push boundaries. Explore characters\u2019 lives through an in-game social media app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/828c5eb14419b85cd76b66a4bb448777.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy around 6 hours of immersive gameplay!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/48d49313a50938aacf84b2ba75829692.avif?t=1771171473\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come Right Inn \u2014 Season 1 (Episodes 1\u20134):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 1 \u2014 First Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 2 \u2014 The Missing Bracelet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 3 \u2014 Behind Closed Doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 4 \u2014 The Turn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb